{
  "name": "checksums",
  "description": "Canonical JSON and ruleset checksums. `checksum` is the checksum of `ruleset`; each entry of `patches` is applied in order and `checksum` there is the checksum after it. Every entry of `canonical` gives a value, its canonical JSON and the SHA-256 hex of that JSON, which is how /sdk/v1/evaluate answers are checked. The rules exercise key order, Unicode keys that sort differently by code point and by UTF-16 unit, numbers and string escapes.",
